#11. Find Minimum Element

Same idea, but use minimum.
int minimum(struct Node *root)
{
    if (root == NULL)
        return 999999;

    int min = root->data;

    int leftMin = minimum(root->left);
    int rightMin = minimum(root->right);

    if (leftMin < min)
        min = leftMin;

    if (rightMin < min)
        min = rightMin;

    return min;
}
Example:
       10
      /  \
     20   30
    / \
   5  50
Output:
Minimum = 5

